<title>MEXICO: New Mexico to Mexico cattle export update - USDA.</title>
<headline>New Mexico to Mexico cattle export update - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Weekly update of New Mexico cattle</p>
<p>exports to Mexico, to Aug 2 - USDA.</p>
<p>(Livestock per head, year in Jan/Dec calendar year).</p>
<p>	Beef cattle		Week	     Year   Year Ago</p>
<p>    Slaughter		     418	    18,105     2,954</p>
<p>    Calves			    0		   1	   0</p>
<p>    Breeding males, females    12	     1,773	 458</p>
<p>	Dairy			Week	     Year   Year Ago</p>
<p>    Breeding males, females   298	     5,723	 822</p>
<p>((--Chris Aspin, Mexico City newsroom +525 7289530))</p>
